5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We should find a way to share these costs that lets us all feel truly at home, without worrying every time we flip a switch.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree. Lately, talking about money has felt tense. I want us to find a balance that keeps our harmony intact.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,Is it fair that we still use the old system? Some of us might be paying for things we don't even use.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,It's definitely getting unpredictable. I want to know exactly what we're dealing with before we commit to a new plan.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I just... I hope the new way isn't too complicated to manage every month.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, your point about fairness is vital. We should look into how much each room actually consumes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, we'll make sure the workload is fair too. Maybe we can see how other houses handle their settling?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"Yes, I'd like to see the actual readings and maybe how the rooms differ in sunlight.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I'm interested in the costs. Let's check the electrician's quote and the last twelve statements to see the swings.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will look into the habits of those who pay ahead. It might give us a clue about the atmosphere.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll check the payment log. I want to see where the delays and frictions have actually happened.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
