18,1,3,pass,May,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look into the reconciliation template and the other house's monthly settle. I want to see the time it takes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
