35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems some rooms are naturally colder, and those who pay a fixed rate feel much more relaxed about using heat.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,The logs show payments are often late because people query the amounts. Even the cooler caused tension last summer.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The monitor showed one person uses four times more than another! It's mostly heaters and computers.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The bills are wild—February was nearly three times August. Also, sub-meters would cost 34,000 yen per room.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The templates and other houses... it takes a lot of time. Logging readings and calculating refunds is a huge chore.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, that installation cost is quite steep. But @Minato's discovery about the usage gap explains the friction.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"If we keep querying every change, we'll keep fighting. We need a system that doesn't require constant justification.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"But if one person uses four times as much, is it right for the others to pay for it?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, precision is great, but 170,000 yen for meters is a lot of money upfront.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,And the person doing the math... they'd spend hours every month if we go too detailed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,We must choose between the precision of the meter and the peace of a fixed agreement.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, if the system is too hard, the person managing it will end up resentful.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,I just don't want anyone to feel like they are carrying someone else's burden.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,The monthly swings are the problem. We need something that smooths out those peaks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with May. Something simple that doesn't require a spreadsheet every single week.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us consider the options then. We need a balance of fairness, ease, and comfort.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"As long as it stops the accusations, I'm open to suggestions.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I'm still worried about the usage gap, but I see the cost issue.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,Let's see what the actual options are.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope it's not the one with the most paperwork.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
