60,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option B, the Seasonal Fixed Rate, sounds like it would bring the most peace and warmth to the house.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Option C is the simplest, but Option B might stop the monthly arguments about fluctuations.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A is the only one that is truly fair given the usage gap I found.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,Option A is too expensive upfront. Option B solves the budget spikes I'm worried about.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Option C is the least work, but Option B is also manageable if we only settle once a year.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, while A is precise, would the cost and the effort @Daisuke mentioned not create new tensions?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, if we use Option C, we just divide by five. No one has to justify their usage.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"But Option C doesn't fix the ""carrying"" problem. It just ignores it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, the installation cost for A is almost a whole winter's worth of bills. It's not practical.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,Option A sounds like a nightmare to manage. I'd rather do B or C.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,I vote for B. It encourages us to be generous and not count every watt.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'll go with B as well. It smooths over the monthly friction and the seasonal shocks.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,"I still prefer A, but if everyone hates the cost, I'll vote C to at least keep it equal.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,I'm voting for B. Predictability is exactly what I need for my budget.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll vote B. One big settle a year is better than monthly battles.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
